  "knownIssues": [
    "Brand new: this ready-made build hasn't been played by anyone yet, so expect rough edges.",
    "Turn off DLSS, FSR and XeSS upscaling and frame generation, motion blur and depth of field: they break how the two pictures line up.",
    "Only Cyberpunk 2.31 works. A game update stops it until the mods catch up.",
    "Up to 400 placed blocks are solid for V, and each is a full cube.",
    "If you use other Cyberpunk mods that need a newer Codeware, they may stop working while this is installed.",
    "Cyberpunk 2077 starts in borderless full screen, which works best with Minecraft, and skips its own launcher window. Steam asks you to allow this each time: click Continue."
  ]
